    "description": "<p>Increases the target’s armor (max 35) for <span style=\"font-family:Signika, sans-serif\">{{math spellPower \"*\" 5}}</span>  minutes. Grants +10% defense and cover, but imposes -5% to hit (combat) and -10% Ranged / Thrown / Channeling penalties. Max speed reduced to 4. Initiative penalty -4. Acrobatics and dodge capped at 20% success. Greatly increases weight (cannot swim, cannot be pushed, etc.). Unarmored targets gain 2 armor health.</p>",
